  "about_item": [
    "ENHANCED FEEDING EXPERIENCE: The LickiMat Outdoor Keeper extends your LickiMat to a full high-capacity feeder, perfect for small and small-medium dogs, providing an enriched licking experience or combining with food.",
    "MISHAP PROTECTION AND TRAINING AID: Safeguard your LickiMat from mishaps and protect its edges with the versatile design of the Outdoor Keeper. It's a valuable tool for training your dog or puppy to lick, but supervision and training remain essential.",
    "EASY TO CLEAN: Enjoy hassle-free cleaning with the Outdoor Keeper, as it is 100% dishwasher safe. The freezer-friendly and microwave-safe design adds convenience to your pet's mealtime routine. Dimensions: 8\" x 8\" x 2\" (20 x 20 x 5 cm).",
    "STABILITY AND HIGH CAPACITY: Equipped with non-slip rubber feet, the Outdoor Keeper ensures stability while holding up to 3 cups of food. Ideal for various food types, including dry food, soaked kibble, wet food, canned food, raw food, bone broth, liquid food, and even doggie ice cream.",
    "SAFE AND DURABLE: Crafted from food-safe polypropylene, the Outdoor Keeper is BPA-free, PVC-free, phthalate-free, and silicone-free. Rest easy knowing it's 100% dishwasher safe, providing a reliable and safe feeding solution for your furry friend."
  ],
